In the meantime, it might be helpful to consider whether a family member or someone with authorized access to your account could have made this purchase. Sometimes, charges may also stem from subscriptions or recurring payments that are easy to overlook.

If we determine that the charge is indeed unauthorized, I'll assist you with the next steps to dispute the charge and secure your account. 

Please share your account verification details whenever you're ready, and we can proceed from there.

